	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p1365">Grynęus</persName> et ego fuimus una <placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName> cum <persName ref="p5565">Capitone</persName> et <persName ref="p467">Bucero</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zur <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Sondersynode vom September 1537 s. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>.</note> senatu nostro <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sic iubente, postquam <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName> petierant<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. oben <ref target="file11083">Nr. 1041</ref>, 2-4.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">In mandatis fuit, ut essemus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mediatores, si res postularet, id quod fecimus pro virili.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> noluit <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>apud <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> ut amicos venerandos male audire, tanquam egisset contra <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>disputationem<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Gemeint ist die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Disputation von 1528; vgl. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>, 55-58. 92-98.</note>, in qua non segniter pugnarat, vel contra synodum, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>cuius decreta conscripserat <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Der <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> Synodus von 1532. Edition und Abhandlungen zum Jubiläumsjahr 1982, hg. v. Forschungsseminar für Reformationstheologie unter der Leitung von Gottfried W. Locher, 2 Bde., Neukirchen-Vluyn 1984/1988.</note>, vel contra confessionem com<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>munem, quam nos omnes simul confecimus<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Das Erste <placeName ref="l862">Helvetische</placeName> Bekenntnis von 1536; vgl. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>, 76-83 mit Anm. 18.</note>, vel tanquam in negocio concordię <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fuisset perfidus.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ut igitur sese multis excusavit, ita satisfecit et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>senatui et fratribus, quamobrem etiam testimonium urso consignatum<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">d. h. eine mit dem Siegel <placeName ref="l41">Berns</placeName> versehene Urkunde.</note> abstulit, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>cuius exemplar ad te nunc mitto<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Das den <placeName ref="l491">Straßburgern</placeName> am 23. September ausgestellte Zeugnis (vgl. oben <ref target="file11088">Nr. 1045</ref>, 209-216), das die Ergebnisse der Tagung zusammenfaßt, findet sich in Kopie in Zürich StA, E II 337, 240r.-243r.; vgl. auch <hi>Straßer</hi> 143f.</note>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Non dubium est, quin probaturus sis.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Utinam actioni interfuisses, quo vidisses etiam, quam esset hac parte synceriter <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>actum!</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">In itinere sępe dictum inter nos: "<persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> nimirum aderit <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>vocatus a fratribus <placeName ref="l41">Bernensibus</placeName>; nam ita nihil non futurum esset perfectius."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Sed spe frustrati perreximus et rem perduximus, quo vides.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Consensus in <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>eucharistiae causa firmatus est et fraternitas pristina veluti renovata.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Ego quidem puto<pb type="edition" next="261"/> deum in medio nostri fuisse; tam species erat <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>horribilis primo intuitu.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Iam si calculus tuus accesserit, spes erit <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ecclesias Christi futuras sine schismate.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Hic adiungerem exhortationem; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>verum quia circa veritatem apud te nihil hac opus est, unum illud dico: <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Expendito, quę sunt acta, ut pro veritate, ut sunt, accipias, et omnia er<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>unt in tuto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Explicatius imaginem horrendam istam exposuero: Postquam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>in ditionem <placeName ref="l41">Bernens[em]</placeName> intraveramus, adcurrunt fratres manus sustollentes o<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>b adventum et domino gratiis actis inquiunt: "Nisi praesentia vestra discordiam, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>quae est in ecclesia nostra, sustuleritis, actum est et de nobis et de evangelio.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Surgunt enim de novo catabaptistę, minantur rustici cędem, respectant <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ad bona ecclesię, capita erigunt adulteri, pensionarii, papistae.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Unde <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>non est quies nobis; adeo circumdederunt nos pericula."</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Deinde, ubi venim<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>us in urbem, de cęde plane cantio eadem non solum a plebe, sed etiam a senatoribus<lb xml:id="p1z29"/>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ducti catabaptistę captivi<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">1537 sollen in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> mehrere Täufer hingerichtet worden sein, doch ist darüber nichts Näheres bekannt; s. Theodor <hi>de Quervain,</hi> Kirchliche und soziale Zustände in <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> unmittelbar nach der Einführung der Reformation (1528-1536), <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> 1906, S. 149. 155f.</note> magis movebant et animos et o<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ra, ut videlicet ita loquerentur: "Quid hoc rei?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Boni illi sic ducuntur, nec est causa <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>condigna.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quidni sic agitur cum pfaffis nostris, qui tanta seminant <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>palam dissidia in ecclesiam et rempublicam nostram" etc.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Vide, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>speciem.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Quid putas hic nos cogitasse consultasseque?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Tollendę <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>primum erant suspiciones malę contra <placeName ref="l491">Argentinenses</placeName>, deinde concordia <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>communis concilianda, tum discordiae privatę (quę pestilentissima) furor consopiendus; <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>tandem et <placeName ref="l167">Gebennenses</placeName> erant reducendi in viam<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p1049">Farel</persName>, <persName ref="p540">Calvin</persName> und <persName ref="p3429">Viret</persName> verteidigten am 22. September die Verwendung des Namens Jehova für Christus; ihre schriftliche Erklärung wurde von <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName>, <persName ref="p5565">Capito</persName>, <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> und <persName ref="p1365">Grynäus</persName> unterzeichnet (<bibl>CO</bibl> IX 708-710). Die <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> unterschrieben außerdem ein Abendmahlsbekenntnis der <placeName ref="l167">Genfer</placeName> (<bibl>CO</bibl> IX 711f). Vgl. Corr. des réformateurs IV 301, Anm. 3f, <hi>Straßer</hi> 145-147, und unten <ref target="file11097">Nr. 1054</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Haec autem omnia sic con<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>fecit dominus, ut omnia bona speranda mihi videantur in futurum, modo eum, qui <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>dedit finem tam optatum, invocemus, ut nos iugiter respiciat et in officio <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>contineat.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Tum etiam caveat, ne sint instigatores mali, qui ignem <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>consopitum denuo conentur excitare.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Igitur te quęso per dominum, diligentiam<pb type="scan" next="||169v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>adhibeas, ne malum discordię apud illos resurgat et inter nos etiam caveatur; <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>nam hoc si feceris pro authoritate, quam habes, melius facere non poteris.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Prohibeto <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>similiter, ne ex tuis aliqui frigidam suffundant<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">im Sinne von: Öl ins Feuer gießen; Adagia, 1, 10, 51 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 382).</note>.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Intellexi enim, quos quidam sibi <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>confugium statuerint.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Illi quales quantive sint, non decet ecclesiam dissidere, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sed connivere<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl>, 1, 8, 50 (<bibl source="b370">LB</bibl> II 317).</note> potius ad innumera, quo unitas possit retineri.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Equidem non dubito, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quin, dum hoc factum fuerit, brevi veniatur huc, ut deinceps connivere non <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>sit opus.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Sit concordia, et dominus erit inter nos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><pb type="edition" next="262"/>Vale, mi <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, et <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>uxorem<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="12"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> salutato et fratres in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileae</placeName>, 4. octobris anno 37.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z9"/><persName ref="p8418">Os. Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z3"/>D<lb xml:id="p3z4"/>omin<lb xml:id="p3z5"/>o <persName ref="p495">Heinric<lb xml:id="p3z6"/>ho Bullinge<lb xml:id="p3z7"/>ro</persName> doctis<lb xml:id="p3z8"/>simo, <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>ministro Christi, <lb xml:id="p3z10"/>dom<lb xml:id="p3z11"/>ino et fratri in <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>domino chari<lb xml:id="p3z13"/>ssimo suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
